OL,3,GNEWSASchools told to check fire risk
OL,4,Aafter canopy blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools across Norfolk have been told
OL,7,Fto assess their fire risk after
OL,8,Fsunlight on a plastic canopy sparked a
OL,9,Fblaze that damaged three classrooms.
OL,11,FFire ripped through Thomas Bullock
OL,12,FPrimary Academy in Shipdham, near
OL,13,FDereham, having spread from a shelter
OL,14,Fin the school playground during
OL,15,Fextremely hot weather on 13 August.
OL,17,FNorfolk County Council described it as
OL,18,F"a very uncommon incident triggered by
OL,19,Fa very specific set of circumstances".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
